    "property_title": "PRIME LOT FOR SALE IN IPONAN, CAGAYAN DE ORO",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "1,211 SQM Prime Lot in a Fast-Growing Community\r\n\r\nSecure a rare opportunity to own a spacious property in one of Cagayan de Oro City's rapidly developing areas. Strategically located in Iponan, this 1,211 SQM prime lot offers excellent accessibility, outstanding development potential, and strong long-term investment value.\r\n\r\nWhether you're planning to build your dream home, develop a townhouse community, construct apartment units, establish a commercial space, or simply invest in a property with excellent appreciation potential, this lot provides the flexibility to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nProperty Details\r\nProperty Type: Residential / Investment Lot\r\nLocation: Iponan, Cagayan de Oro City\r\nLot Area: 1,211 SQM\r\nSelling Price: PHP 38,000 per sqm\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n-Prime and highly accessible location\r\n-Near the National Highway\r\n-Close to CHAMS\r\n-Near Petron\r\n-Wide frontage\r\n-Ideal for residential development\r\n-Suitable for apartment and townhouse projects\r\n-Potential for commercial development\r\n-Excellent long-term investment opportunity\r\n-Located within a fast-growing community\r\n\r\nWhy Invest in Iponan?\r\nIponan has become one of the fastest-growing communities in Cagayan de Oro City, attracting homeowners, developers, and investors because of its strategic location and improving infrastructure. The area offers convenient access to major roads, commercial establishments, schools, fuel stations, and other essential services while continuing to experience steady residential and commercial growth.\r\nWith its generous lot size and excellent location, this property presents a valuable opportunity for future development and long-term capital appreciation.\r\n\r\nCommercial Establishments\r\n-CHAMS\r\n-Petron Iponan\r\n-Public Market\r\n-Grocery Stores\r\n-Restaurants and Cafés\r\n-Banks and Convenience Stores\r\n\r\nSchools\r\n-Nearby public and private schools\r\n-Educational institutions within the Iponan area\r\n\r\nAccessibility\r\n-Immediate access to the National Highway\r\n-Approximately 15–20 minutes to Cagayan de Oro City Proper\r\n-Convenient access to public transportation\r\n-Easy connection to nearby commercial and residential communities\r\n\r\nIdeal For\r\n-Dream Home Construction\r\n-Townhouse Development\r\n-Apartment Complex\r\n-Commercial Establishment\r\n-Mixed-Use Development\r\n-Long-Term Property Investment",
